{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111207001:2":{"text":"うわぁ！お姉ちゃんのシッポ、ふわふわだぁ！わたしもこんなシッポがほしいなぁ！","source_cn":"哇……姐姐，你的尾巴真蓬松啊，我也想要你这样蓬松的尾巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CB6F43CFA48C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111207002:2":{"text":"引っ張らないでよ！羨ましがっても尻尾はあげられないわよ！","source_cn":"别揪了！我的尾巴不可能切下来装在你身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x105D227EEE2175F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111207003:2":{"text":"お姉ちゃんはどっからきたの？初めて会うよね？何歳？その手に持ってるのはおもちゃ？遊んでもいい！？","source_cn":"姐姐，你是哪来的？从来没见过你呢。你多大了？你手里的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE82726A684E2271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111207004:2":{"text":"だーめー！","source_cn":"——不可以！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8B0733F744F6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111207005:4":{"text":"何をしている、みんなやめるんだ！","source_cn":"你们在干什么？都给我住手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7962F7BDACED65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111207006:1":{"text":"もう、無理！なんなのよここは……子どもとバウンティハンターだらけじゃない！今すぐ出てってやる！","source_cn":"受不了了！看看这个奇怪的地方……一群孩子，还有一群赏金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF6780DE050CA25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111207007:1":{"text":"サテラ！待って――","source_cn":"等等！萨忒娜——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAABBFAC867DB6D96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111207008:1":{"text":"君もだよアンダンドラ！今すぐあたしとここから離れて！","source_cn":"至于你！安丹德拉，你必须和我一起走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F243EB56C136CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111207009:1":{"text":"なっ、とにかく冷静になって――","source_cn":"什么？你先冷静点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DDA810882297797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111207010:1":{"text":"あたしは十分冷静よ！苦労して君のことを探してたのだって、一刻も早くこの砂漠から連れ出すためなんだから！","source_cn":"我很冷静！实话告诉你吧，我千辛万苦来找你，就是为了带你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B710872615F4450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111207011:1":{"text":"アンお姉ちゃんを連れて行っちゃダメー！","source_cn":"你要带走安丹姐？不许！","status":